---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'; import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<Layout title="Services and Pricing — NOVEXA DIGITAL" description="Healthcare website packages with clear inclusions and fixed fees, from $1,650 inc GST. Discovery, design, build, launch and handover.">
<PageHero eyebrow="Services and pricing" title="Useful digital work, shaped around the right problem." intro="NOVEXA connects strategy, content, design and delivery so each decision supports the next. Every package below shows exactly what's included and what it costs." />
<section class="section paper"><div class="container"><div class="grid-3">
<article class="card reveal"><span class="number">01</span><h2 class="h3">Digital direction</h2><p>Discovery, audience and message clarity, digital audits, content priorities and practical roadmaps.</p></article>
<article class="card reveal"><span class="number">02</span><h2 class="h3">Website delivery</h2><p>Information architecture, UX, visual design, responsive development, launch preparation and handover.</p></article>
<article class="card reveal"><span class="number">03</span><h2 class="h3">Content foundations</h2><p>Page frameworks, editorial structure, CMS modelling, migration planning and publishing guidance.</p></article>
</div></div></section>

<section class="section white"><div class="container">
<div class="split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Website packages</p><h2 class="h2">Fixed packages, clear inclusions.</h2></div><p class="lead">All prices are in AUD and GST-inclusive. A formal quote itemises the price excluding GST, GST and the total. Every package includes two consolidated revision rounds, one training session and a 30-day defect warranty.</p></div>

<div class="grid-2" style="margin-top:4rem;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1.2rem">

<article class="package reveal">
<span class="price">Essential</span>
<h3 style="font-size:1.6rem">$1,650 <span style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted)">inc GST</span></h3>
<p class="muted" style="font-size:.85rem">Solo practitioner or small healthcare service needing a credible, focused presence.</p>
<ul style="font-size:.88rem">
<li>Up to 5 standard pages</li>
<li>One homepage design direction</li>
<li>Client-supplied content and images</li>
<li>One contact/enquiry form</li>
<li>Static site — CMS not included</li>
</ul>
<a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Enquire <span>→</span></a>
</article>

<article class="package featured reveal">
<span class="price">Practice</span>
<h3 style="font-size:1.6rem">$3,850 <span style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted)">inc GST</span></h3>
<p class="muted" style="font-size:.85rem">Established practice needing service detail, practitioner profiles and a booking path.</p>
<ul style="font-size:.88rem">
<li>Up to 8 standard pages</li>
<li>Up to 4 practitioner profiles</li>
<li>One booking link/embed</li>
<li>One location, standard map</li>
<li>Basic legacy-URL redirects</li>
</ul>
<a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Enquire <span>→</span></a>
</article>

<article class="package reveal">
<span class="price">Growth</span>
<h3 style="font-size:1.6rem">$6,600 <span style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted)">inc GST</span></h3>
<p class="muted" style="font-size:.85rem">Multi-practitioner clinic needing richer content and controlled self-editing.</p>
<ul style="font-size:.88rem">
<li>Up to 12 standard pages</li>
<li>Up to 8 practitioner profiles</li>
<li>Sanity CMS for up to 3 content types</li>
<li>Up to 2 locations</li>
<li>News/resources index template</li>
</ul>
<a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Enquire <span>→</span></a>
</article>

<article class="package reveal">
<span class="price">Custom Clinic</span>
<h3 style="font-size:1.6rem">From $9,900 <span style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted)">inc GST</span></h3>
<p class="muted" style="font-size:.85rem">Larger or complex healthcare organisations with multiple locations or systems.</p>
<ul style="font-size:.88rem">
<li>Scoped after discovery</li>
<li>Multiple locations/templates</li>
<li>Structured CMS</li>
<li>Approved integrations/migration</li>
<li>Paid discovery stage where needed</li>
</ul>
<a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Enquire <span>→</span></a>
</article>

</div>

<div class="note" style="margin-top:2.5rem"><strong>Every package includes:</strong> responsive design and development on NOVEXA's approved stack, SSL and standard deployment, sitemap and meta descriptions, reasonable browser/device testing, two consolidated revision rounds, one 60-minute training session, handover of agreed assets, and a 30-day post-launch defect warranty. Payment is 50% deposit to commence and 50% before launch.</div>

<div class="note" style="margin-top:1.2rem"><strong>Not included</strong> unless stated: copywriting, logo/brand design, domain/hosting/vendor fees, patient portals or clinical data handling, ongoing SEO, and support after the warranty period. Additional revision effort and post-launch support are billed at $132/hour inc GST ($120/hour ex GST), one-hour minimum.</div>

</div></section>

<section class="section paper"><div class="container"><div class="split">
<div><p class="eyebrow">Also available</p><h2 class="h2">Before or after a website project.</h2></div>
<div class="grid-2" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr">
<article class="package reveal"><span class="price">From $1,500 + GST</span><h3>Clarity Sprint</h3><p class="muted">A focused starting point for one pressing digital question — briefing, review and a prioritised action plan.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Enquire <span>→</span></a></article>
<article class="package reveal"><span class="price">$132/hr inc GST</span><h3>Optional Support</h3><p class="muted">Post-warranty improvements, advice and content support, booked as needed. No forced retainer.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Enquire <span>→</span></a></article>
</div>
</div></div></section>

<section class="section dark"><div class="container split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Ownership</p><h2 class="h2">Built to become yours.</h2></div><div><p class="lead">On final payment, you receive the agreed project files and ownership of the custom deliverables identified in your proposal.</p><p>Third-party software, fonts, stock assets and services remain subject to their own licences. Access, hosting and platform responsibilities are documented at handover so there are no hidden dependencies.</p></div></div></section>
</Layout>
